<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ali | Personal Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; color: #333; }
        header { background: #2c3e50; color: #fff; padding: 1rem 0; text-align: center; position: sticky; top: 0; }
        .container { width: 80%; margin: auto; overflow: hidden; padding: 2rem 0; }
        
        #hero { text-align: center; padding: 50px 0; background: #f4f4f4; }
        #hero h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 3rem; color: #2c3e50; }
        
        .section-title { border-bottom: 2px solid #2c3e50; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
        .card { background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        
        footer { background: #2c3e50; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; margin-top: 40px; }
        a { color: #3498db; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h2>Ali's Portfolio</h2>
    </header>

    <section id="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Hi, I'm Ali</h1>
            <p>Student | Aspiring Developer | Lifelong Learner</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
        <section id="about">
            <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
            <p>I am currently studying [Your Major] with a focus on [Interest]. I love solving complex problems and learning new technologies. When I'm not studying, you can find me [Hobby/Interest].</p>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">
            <h2 class="section-title">Projects</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Project One</h3>
                    <p>A brief description of a cool project Ali worked on in class or as a hobby.</p>
                    <a href="#">View Project →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Project Two</h3>
                    <p>Another example of work, like a research paper, a piece of art, or a coding app.</p>
                    <a href="#">View Project →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact">
            <h2 class="section-title">Get In Touch</h2>
            <p>I'm always open to discussing new opportunities or collaborations.</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:ali@example.com">ali@example.com</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Ali. Built with focus and caffeine.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
